# Scoped VM->Vault network bridge (pf anchor).
#
# Ephemeral Tart build VMs (192.168.64.0/24) need to reach the internal Vault so the mobile-app
# Fastfiles can read signing creds. Vault is VPN-only (utun4, host VPN IP 10.8.0.13). IP forwarding
# is already on and the host routes 10.10/16 -> utun4; the only missing piece is source-NAT so
# Vault's replies return. This NATs ONLY Vault's IPs — every other internal host stays unreachable
# from VMs (no NAT rule -> no return path), so the exposure is limited to Vault.
#
# Vault currently resolves to 10.10.2.142 and 10.10.3.165 (LoadBalancer). If those change, update here.

nat on utun4 inet from 192.168.64.0/24 to { 10.10.2.142, 10.10.3.165 } -> (utun4)
